---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components"

import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro"
import Heading from "@/components/Heading.astro"
import Paragraph from "@/components/Paragraph.astro"
import UnorderedList from "@/components/mdx/UnorderedList.astro"

const summaryStyles =
  "flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"
---

<Layout title="About me" path="/about">
  <main class="space-y-12 py-4 lg:py-8">
    <section>
      <Heading as="h1">About me</Heading>
      <Paragraph>
        My story with the web started with earning my first money designing
        custom MySpace layouts as a kid — and that taste of getting paid for
        something I loved doing is what turned it into a profession. By 2008, at
        16, I was freelancing properly, building sites for a stream of different
        clients and projects.
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph>
        Since then I've worked across the stack: backend in PHP, Node and
        Python, frontend in React (and sometimes Vue), always on a foundation of
        HTML/CSS and JavaScript/TypeScript.
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph>
        In 2016 I made a deliberate switch from founder to employee — trading my
        own business for a seat inside other people's, because I wanted to see
        how companies actually work from the inside. Since then I've worked
        inside startups and companies of very different sizes and stages, and
        picked up something different from each one.
      </Paragraph>
      <Heading as="h2">Founder at heart</Heading>
      <Paragraph>
        That detour was never meant to be permanent. My future is as a founder —
        I love solving problems, I love building things, and, weirdly enough to
        most people, I love the business side of it too: figuring out how to
        turn something useful into something sustainable.
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph>
        Right now, that ambition finds its best expression at Buffer, where I
        get a taste of both worlds — the autonomy of running my own thing,
        paired with leaders I'm still learning a huge amount from.
      </Paragraph>
    </section>

    <section>
      <Heading as="h2">Beyond the code</Heading>
      <Paragraph>
        None of the above is really the point, though. First and foremost I'm a
        dad and a husband, and a diaspora Tamil — fluent in Tamil alongside
        English and German. That last part is what I care about most outside of
        work: preserving and sharing Tamil language and culture through content
        and technology, helping disconnected Tamils rediscover their roots, and
        opening our world up to anyone curious enough to understand us. That's
        the closest thing I have to a personal mission statement.
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph>
        None of these pieces is unique on its own, but the combination is.
        Growing up between cultures, thinking and dreaming in a language most of
        the people around me don't speak, while also being the person who builds
        things in code, gives me a perspective that's hard to come by in either
        world alone.
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph>
        A few things I've come to know are non-negotiable for me:
      </Paragraph>
      <UnorderedList>
        <li>Grow by helping others grow.</li>
        <li>Always be free.</li>
        <li>Be mindful of others and yourself.</li>
        <li>Never stop learning.</li>
        <li>(My) people matter.</li>
      </UnorderedList>
      <Paragraph>
        Outside of all that, staying fit is non-negotiable — it started as an
        attempt to gain some weight and turned into a lifestyle. The kitchen is
        where I get creative: I'm slowly working towards a five-course meal that
        merges Tamil, Japanese and Italian cooking into something that's
        entirely mine. And I read — and lately, write — fiction, because
        following a good detective or adventurer around for a few hundred pages
        is still the fastest way I know to switch my brain off.
      </Paragraph>
    </section>

    <section>
      <header class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
        <Heading as="h2" level="small">Work Experience</Heading>
      </header>
      <div class="divide-y divide-neutral-200">
        <details class="group py-4">
          <summary class={summaryStyles}>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-right-16-solid"
                class="size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:hidden"
              />
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-down-16-solid"
                class="hidden size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:block"
              />
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">
                Senior Software Engineer / Buffer
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-600">October 2025 — now</div>
          </summary>
        </details>
        <details class="group py-4">
          <summary class={summaryStyles}>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-right-16-solid"
                class="size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:hidden"
              />
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-down-16-solid"
                class="hidden size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:block"
              />
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">
                Senior Software Engineer / HubSpot
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-600">
              July 2024 — October 2025
            </div>
          </summary>
          <div class="mt-2 pl-5">
            <Paragraph>
              Working in growth teams with a focus on acquisition and retention
              targetting different external and internal channels.
            </Paragraph>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="group py-4">
          <summary class={summaryStyles}>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-right-16-solid"
                class="size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:hidden"
              />
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-down-16-solid"
                class="hidden size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:block"
              />
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">
                Senior Engineer / Intercom
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-600">April 2024 — June 2024</div>
          </summary>
          <div class="mt-2 pl-5">
            <Paragraph>
              Owning and leading bigger, more strategic projects at team level
              and contributing to the roadmap and technical strategy. I'm also
              coaching and mentoring other team mates to help the entire team
              work as effective as possible
            </Paragraph>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="group py-4">
          <summary class={summaryStyles}>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-right-16-solid"
                class="size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:hidden"
              />
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-down-16-solid"
                class="hidden size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:block"
              />
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">
                Product Engineer 3 / Intercom
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-600">
              December 2021 — March 2024
            </div>
          </summary>
        </details>
        <details class="group py-4">
          <summary class={summaryStyles}>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-right-16-solid"
                class="size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:hidden"
              />
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-down-16-solid"
                class="hidden size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:block"
              />
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">
                Engineering Team Lead / Hussle
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-600">
              April 2021 — November 2021
            </div>
          </summary>
          <div class="mt-2 pl-5">
            <Paragraph>
              As the team could not grow due to the impacts of the pandemic, I
              was guiding and leading the front-end and back-end engineers to
              collaborate and work closely together to help out each other to
              fill gaps
            </Paragraph>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="group py-4">
          <summary class={summaryStyles}>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-right-16-solid"
                class="size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:hidden"
              />
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-down-16-solid"
                class="hidden size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:block"
              />
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">
                Senior Frontend Engineer / Hussle
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-600">
              February 2020 — March 2021
            </div>
          </summary>
          <div class="mt-2 pl-5">
            <Paragraph>
              In 2020, I made the decision to make another big step and moved to
              London to work in FitTech at Hussle. This was my chance to combine
              my passion for fitness with my passion for tech.
            </Paragraph>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="group py-4">
          <summary class={summaryStyles}>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-right-16-solid"
                class="size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:hidden"
              />
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-down-16-solid"
                class="hidden size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:block"
              />
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">
                Software Engineer / Teamleader
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-600">May 2018 — January 2020</div>
          </summary>
        </details>
        <details class="group py-4">
          <summary class={summaryStyles}>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-right-16-solid"
                class="size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:hidden"
              />
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-down-16-solid"
                class="hidden size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:block"
              />
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">Founder / Aheenam</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-600">May 2016 — October 2021</div>
          </summary>
          <div class="mt-2 pl-5">
            <Paragraph>
              In 2016, I decided decrease client work and focus more on
              creating software products. Therefore, I changed the type of my
              business and created a custom brand for this company
            </Paragraph>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="group py-4">
          <summary class={summaryStyles}>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-right-16-solid"
                class="size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:hidden"
              />
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-down-16-solid"
                class="hidden size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:block"
              />
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">
                Web Developer / netinsiders
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-600">
              November 2016 — April 2018
            </div>
          </summary>
        </details>
        <details class="group py-4">
          <summary class={summaryStyles}>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-right-16-solid"
                class="size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:hidden"
              />
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-down-16-solid"
                class="hidden size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:block"
              />
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">Co-Founder / Kernwerk</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-600">
              October 2015 — January 2018
            </div>
          </summary>
          <div class="mt-2 pl-5">
            <Paragraph>
              Together with some friends, I created an awesome app for digital
              personal training. I created the backend of first MVP using
              Laravel as the framework of choice. Due to lack of time and shift
              of interests, I left this project by the end of 2017.
            </Paragraph>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="group py-4">
          <summary class={summaryStyles}>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-right-16-solid"
                class="size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:hidden"
              />
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-down-16-solid"
                class="hidden size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:block"
              />
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">
                Product Assistant / Kopierland GmbH
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-600">June 2011 — March 2014</div>
          </summary>
        </details>
        <details class="group py-4">
          <summary class={summaryStyles}>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-right-16-solid"
                class="size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:hidden"
              />
              <Icon
                name="heroicons:chevron-down-16-solid"
                class="hidden size-3.5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 group-open:block"
              />
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">
                Web Designer / rathesDot (CreativeCreation)
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-600">June 2006 — March 2016</div>
          </summary>
          <div class="mt-2 pl-5">
            <Paragraph>
              Earning my first money creating custom MySpace layouts, I went on
              to create custom websites for various customer of different sizes
              as a freelancer
            </Paragraph>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
